  metaDescription: "The Magus Circle characters include six playable mages (Milk, Macha, Coffee, Anchan, Wheel, Hermit), a crazy flower girl unlockable, and the familiars raised in the Magus Mansion. Patch 1.0.3 closed the Poppet Master upgrade and the pre-Matcha Milk lock.",
